flowchart LR
    subgraph Orchestrator [PR Pipeline]
        AF[Autofix: eslint/prettier]
        G[All 6 gates in parallel\nMetadata, Lint, Build, Tests, Security, Docs]
        AF --> G
    end

    subgraph Agents [Remediation agents, one per failed gate]
        direction TB
        A1[Agent: Fix Metadata via API]
        A2[Agent: Fix Lint]
        A4[Agent: Generate Unit Tests]
        A3[Agent: Patch Vulns]
        A5[Agent: Generate Docs]
    end

    G -->|needs-metadata| A1
    G -->|lint-failed| A2
    G -->|test-required| A4
    G -->|security alerts| A3
    G -->|docs-required| A5

    A1 & A2 & A3 & A4 & A5 --> Relay[Relay: merge stacked PR,\nre-check that gate only]
    Relay --> V{pr-quality verdict}
    G --> V
    V -->|all green, some carried over| AF
    V -->|still failing, nothing repairing| Fail[❌ Fail with error]
    V -->|all green on this commit| Dispatcher[Review Dispatcher] --> Review[Developer Final Sign-Off & Merge]
